 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0029/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0029</a>|2026/06/12 18:12| 01 | 162| 010| 1313| 0140| 1064| 1469|    \n  <a href=\"CME0028/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0028</a>|2026/06/12 16:50| 01 | 063| 008| 0400| 0018| 0395| 0434|    \n  <a href=\"CME0027/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0027</a>|2026/06/11 23:24| 01 | 130| 010| 0425| 0129| 0372| 0710|    \n  <a href=\"CME0026/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0026</a>|2026/06/11 18:24| 04 | 163| 032| 0379| 0286| 0107| 1072|    \n  <a href=\"CME0025/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0025</a>|2026/06/11 15:00| 01 | 178| 006| 0110| 0068| 0108| 0246|    \n  <a href=\"CME0024/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0024</a>|2026/06/11 07:36| 01 | 104| 014| 068"
